    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610570/extras/7b6dc1f16e26c8f3d547e20afba74944.avif?t=1754827957\" width=616 height=134 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Welcome to the Darkest Edge</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You discover a sinister, cube-shaped artifact. Driven by curiosity, you open it, and the world crumbles, awakening you on the border between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Reality Blurs with the Unknown</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every place is a twisted reflection of reality. The Edge is not empty, entities from beyond death are ready to take you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Your Mission</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, you must collect soul fragments scattered throughout intricate labyrinths using the artifact. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Features</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro PS1 Aesthetic: Immerse yourself in a nostalgic, low-poly visual style reminiscent of classic '90s PlayStation titles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entities: Face the darkness and what it hides; every threat has its own rules.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compelling Objective: Gather mystical soul fragments scattered across the dimension to reclaim your essence and defy the boundary between life and death.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pac-Man Inspired Gameplay: Experience an innovative, first-person twist on the classic Pac-Man formula, blending timeless nostalgia with modern dynamics.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Welcome to the Darkest Edge</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You discover a sinister, cube-shaped artifact. Driven by curiosity, you open it, and the world crumbles, awakening you on the border between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Reality Blurs with the Unknown</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every place is a twisted reflection of reality. The Edge is not empty, entities from beyond death are ready to take you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Your Mission</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, you must collect soul fragments scattered throughout intricate labyrinths using the artifact. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Features</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro PS1 Aesthetic: Immerse yourself in a nostalgic, low-poly visual style reminiscent of classic '90s PlayStation titles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entities: Face the darkness and what it hides; every threat has its own rules.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compelling Objective: Gather mystical soul fragments scattered across the dimension to reclaim your essence and defy the boundary between life and death.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pac-Man Inspired Gameplay: Experience an innovative, first-person twist on the classic Pac-Man formula, blending timeless nostalgia with modern dynamics.</p></li></ul>",
